cell can be referred to by number. This notebook keeps its variables in a \
private context (CellContext -> Notebook), so definitions left over from \
other notebooks in the same session cannot interfere with it.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6b3e7b90-5578-4600-85e3-87ba6fa2025d"],

