Cell["\<\
Biologists describe such a gene as a switch with a dimmer that suddenly snaps \
on. In the language of this notebook it is one S-shaped unit reading a graded \
input.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c50b5108-5fd4-424c-9a3a-7d9358ef487d"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["0.4 Diffusion fronts and diffusion saturation", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"d6d7d4af-ce92-4877-9b96-755c4dfd083a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Diffusion produces S-shapes in both space and time. Suppose a substance at \
concentration ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["C", "0"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6286a3f0-502a-49f2-8905-e54764a126d7"],
 " fills the region x < 0 and is absent from x > 0, for example a signalling \
molecule at the edge of a tissue. Solving Fick's second law gives an \
error-function front [0.11]:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"13aeb400-6f90-422e-825f-96cf29035f2c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"C", "(", 
     RowBox[{"x", ",", "t"}], ")"}], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     FractionBox[
      SubscriptBox["C", "0"], "2"], " ", 
     RowBox[{"erfc", "(", 
      FractionBox["x", 
       RowBox[{"2", 
        SqrtBox[
         RowBox[{"D", " ", "t"}]]}]], ")"}]}], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox["C", "0"], " ", 
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "erf"], "(", 
      RowBox[{"-", 
       FractionBox["x", 
        RowBox[{"2", 
         SqrtBox[
          RowBox[{"D", " ", "t"}]]}]]}], ")"}]}]}], "        ", 
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"(", "0.4", ")"}],
    FontSlant->"Plain"]}], TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->\
"4e655fdc-5a96-4240-85bf-ea81b3432789"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Here ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[Sigma]", "erf"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "75758bd3-3dad-40a8-a0b6-f6219cd428e4"],
 "(s) = (1 + erf s)/2 is the error-function sigmoid of Figure 1. The front \
has width of the order of the diffusion length 2\[Sqrt](D t), which grows \
only like the square root of time. With a constant source at the boundary of \
a half-space, the profile is the complementary error function itself."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0df55852-9d7c-46da-b4cc-17d10b262aa4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Seen from a fixed point x > 0, the concentration starts flat, rises, and \
saturates towards ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["C", "0"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "059ccd74-18d7-4469-a60d-a83b251917f2"],
 "/2: an S-shaped curve in time, which is clearest on a logarithmic time \
axis. This is diffusion saturation. A related case is uptake through carriers \
in a cell membrane, which saturates hyperbolically with concentration \
(Michaelis\[Dash]Menten kinetics) and looks S-shaped on a logarithmic \
concentration axis."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"86d9514e-1b31-4755-8b6a-6d628971ef8e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Figure 0.4. (a) Concentration profiles of Eq. (0.4) after 0.1 s, 1 s and 10 \
s, with x in \[Mu]m. (b) Concentration at x = 100 \[Mu]m against time on a \
logarithmic axis. D = 1000 \[Mu]m\.b2/s (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox["10", 
    RowBox[{"-", "9"}]], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d4e94b96-1ae5-4a44-af0d-77a89ae8eae2"],
 " m\.b2/s), of the order of a small molecule in water."
}], "Caption",
 FontSize->14,
 FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->"76c5798c-a6fe-4662-ab58-6134be6b93ff"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["(*c.0.4*)\ndC = 1000.;   (* diffusion coefficient in \[Mu]m^2/s *)\ncdiff[x_, t_] := Erfc[x/(2 Sqrt[dC t])]/2;\nPrint[\"Eq. (0.4), erfc = reflected erf sigmoid: \",\n  FullSimplify[Erfc[s]/2 == 1 - (1 + Erf[s])/2]];\nLabeled[\n Grid[{{\n    Plot[Evaluate@Table[cdiff[x, t], {t, {0.1, 1, 10}}], {x, -300, 300},\n     Ticks -> {{-200, 0, 200}, Automatic}, AxesLabel -> {\"x\", \"C/C0\"},\n     PlotLabel -> \"0.4a. profile\",\n     PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[{\"0.1 s\", \"1 s\", \"10 s\"},\n        LabelStyle -> figStyle], Below],\n     LabelStyle -> figStyle, ImageSize -> wHalf],\n    LogLinearPlot[cdiff[100, t], {t, 0.1, 1000}, PlotRange -> {0, 0.55},\n     Ticks -> {{0.1, 1, 10, 100, 1000}, Automatic},\n     AxesLabel -> {\"t (s)\", \"C/C0\"}, PlotLabel -> \"0.4b. at x = 100\",\n     LabelStyle -> figStyle, ImageSize -> wHalf]}}],\n Style[\"Figure 0.4. Diffusion\", figFont], Top]", "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[29]:=",ExpressionUUID->"73ac8990-7063-4b61-8313-293d845d4fb1"],

Cell[BoxData[
 InterpretationBox[
  RowBox[{"\<\"Eq. (0.4), erfc = reflected erf sigmoid: \"\>", "\[InvisibleSpace]",
    "True"}],
  SequenceForm["Eq. (0.4), erfc = reflected erf sigmoid: ", True],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.0037895625374527`*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "During evaluation of \
In[29]:=",ExpressionUUID->"923aac58-c254-49c8-a531-975cbfb3fc8f"],

